  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n<b>Animal shelters</b> are shelters for animals, either farm animals or pets. Building a shelter costs 5 to 45,000 coins and doesn't require time.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Shelters for farm animals</b></span></h3>\n<p>Player needs to purchase shelter from their shop first in order to purchase the according farm animal. Farm animals live inside the shelter. Player needs to use <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed Mill</a> to produce feed to feed farm animals to collect animal goods after a period of time.\n</p><p>Bees and squirrels are fed with bushes, and their shelter can be mastered to be more productive by having enough bushes and collecting their output.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"350px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Chicken_Coop.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Coop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Chicken_Coop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20150713110707\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Cow_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111500\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow Pasture\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Cow_Pasture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20150713111500\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Pig_Pen.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111450\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig Pen\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Pig_Pen.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20150713111450\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e0/Sheep_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111444\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-coop-2715\" title=\"Chicken Coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chicken Coop</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cow Pasture</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pig Pen</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sheep Pasture</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 <a href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chickens</a> each\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cows</a> each\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pigs</a> each\n</td>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/sheep-2350\" title=\"Sheep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sheep</a> each\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 houses unlocked at level 1,12,23\n</td>\n<td>3 houses unlocked at level 6,15,27\n</td>\n<td>3 houses unlocked at level 10,18,32\n</td>\n<td>3 houses unlocked at level 16,26,42\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7d/Lamb_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20260511221917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"44\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Goat_Yard.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111228\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Beehive_Tree_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/27/Squirrel_House_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"105\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lamb Pasture</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Goat Yard</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Beehive Tree</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Squirrel House</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 <a href=\"/wiki/lamb-36739\" title=\"Lamb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lamb</a> each\n</td>\n<td>4 <a href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">goats</a> each\n</td>\n<td>1-4 beehives\n</td>\n<td>1-4 squirrels\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 25,30\n</td>\n<td>3 houses unlocked at level 32,37,50\n</td>\n<td>Unlocked at level 39, can be mastered\n</td>\n<td>Unlocked at level 62, can be mastered\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Shelters for pets</b></span></h3>\n<p>When purchasing pets, they need to be placed outside of their shelters, and pets don't live inside their shelter. Players feed bacon, milk or carrot (depend on pet species) to pets to get xp and sometimes they also give players <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>. Each pet shelter can only hold a maximum of 3 pets.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" width=\"350px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b8/Dog_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110655\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dog House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FBird%20House.png\" title=\"Special:FilePath/Bird House.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"106\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/80/Cat_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110615\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cat House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/24/Horse_Stable.png/revision/latest?cb=20180207151638\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Horse Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9e/Bunny_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111751\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bunny House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/dog-house-2713\" title=\"Dog House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dog House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bird House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/cat-house-2711\" title=\"Cat House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cat House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/horse-stable-2709\" title=\"Horse Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Horse Stable</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/bunny-house-12523\" title=\"Bunny House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bunny House</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 20,28\n</td>\n<td>1 house unlocked at level 20\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 21,29\n</td>\n<td>4 houses unlocked at level 27,37,40,47\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 31,41\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7f/Alpaca_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20260608154851\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alpaca House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Puppy_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110633\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Donkey_Stable.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111214\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Donkey Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/29/Kitten_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20160327193426\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kitten House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c7/Guinea_Pig_House.png/revision/latest?cb=20210814222638\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/alpaca-house-36823\" title=\"Alpaca House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alpaca House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Puppy House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/donkey-stable-9426\" title=\"Donkey Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Donkey Stable</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/kitten-house-18341\" title=\"Kitten House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kitten House</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Guinea Pig House</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 34\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 35,50\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 43,55\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 49,58\n</td>\n<td>2 houses unlocked at level 60,64\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831185048\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 206/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 114/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    3.103      1 -total\n 56.40%    1.750      1 Template:Languages\n 39.73%    1.233      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:33414-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831185048 and revision id 110472. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
